      "title": "New delete routes have no tests",
      "description": "The change adds two routes that delete users, and no test file exists in the repository. No test covers authorization, unknown ids or the purge count. Regressions like the missing admin check and the crash on unknown ids can ship unnoticed. Add route tests for non-admin callers, unknown ids and the purge response count.",
